# React

Export named function components. Handlers inside a component are arrow functions.

Use `Show` for optional UI and `ListRenderer` for lists. Pass `keyOverride`.

Route strings live in `PATHS` under `apps/web-app/src/constants/paths.ts`.

Page templates render. `useNotes` and later view-model hooks live in `@repo/data`.

shadcn components live in `@repo/ui`. Add them with the shadcn CLI from `apps/web-app` so the `ui` alias writes into the package. If a file lands in the app, move it.
